# Downloaded and derived media — everything here rebuilds from the assets
# mirror plus the tracked scripts and receipts. (out/ is already covered
# repo-wide by `pop/**/out/`.)

# the six h0t source mp4s — re-fetchable from the mirror posts.json points at
source/

